# Flatpak build artefacts. `.flatpak-builder/` is the tool's own cache and runs
# to gigabytes; `build-dir/` and `repo/` are what a local `npm run flatpak:build`
# leaves behind. The committed side of Flatpak packaging is flatpak/ only.
.flatpak-builder/
build-dir/
repo/
*.flatpak
flatpak/node_modules/
